<title>UK: Colombia prices 275 million mark five-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Colombia prices 275 million mark five-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue has been priced, joint lead managers Deutsche Morgan Grenfell and Merrill Lynch said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   COLOMBIA</p>
<p> AMT    275 MLN DEM   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    21.NOV.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +140 BP   PAY DATE    21.NOV.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY BAA3	ISS PRICE  101.79    FULL FEES   2.50</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   BBB-	REOFFER    99.915    YIELD     3ML +142 BP</p>
<p> LISTING    FRANKFURT DENOMS (K) 1	   SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  COLOMBIA  TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC  1.375     LISTING FEE 0.50</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
